<h2>B-Series: Double Width</h2>
<p class="ug-body">B-series formats use double-width panels, giving the container more horizontal space while maintaining the same column counts.</p>

<h3>B1 Format (1 column, double width)</h3>

<CodeExample title="B1 format">
<Fragment set:html={`<div class="ug-format ug-format--b1" style="background:#f5f2ed;padding:1rem">
  <div class="ug-grid">
    <div style="background:#e8e5e0;padding:1rem;text-align:center">Full width content (double panel)</div>
  </div>
</div>`} />
</CodeExample>

<h3>B2 Format (2 columns, double width)</h3>

